# The cow demo script (REQ-DEMO-002). Each step changes one setting.
# Line: <tick> <command> [arguments]. +N: N ticks after the line before.
# Commands: caption <text>, set <setting> <value>, checkpoint <name>, end.
# The settings are the fields of CowSettings (demos/common/cow_scene.zig).

# Tick 0 sets every setting, so each loop starts the same.
0 set aa off
0 set meshing greedy
0 set wireframe off
0 set tonemap aces
0 set exposure 1.0
0 set palette classic
0 set time 0.4
0 set shadows on
0 set ao on
0 set fog on
0 set sky on
0 set spin 0.5

0 caption Anti-aliasing: off
0 set aa off
100 checkpoint aa_off

120 caption Anti-aliasing: FXAA
120 set aa fxaa
220 checkpoint aa_fxaa

240 caption Anti-aliasing: MSAA 4x
240 set aa msaa
340 checkpoint aa_msaa

360 caption Meshing: naive, one quad per face
360 set aa fxaa
360 set meshing naive
360 set wireframe on
460 checkpoint mesh_naive

480 caption Meshing: greedy, merged quads
480 set meshing greedy
580 checkpoint mesh_greedy

600 caption Tonemap: clamp
600 set wireframe off
600 set tonemap clamp
700 checkpoint tonemap_clamp

720 caption Tonemap: Reinhard
720 set tonemap reinhard
820 checkpoint tonemap_reinhard

840 caption Tonemap: ACES
840 set tonemap aces
940 checkpoint tonemap_aces

960 caption Exposure: 0.5
960 set exposure 0.5
1060 checkpoint exposure_low

1080 caption Exposure: 2.0
1080 set exposure 2.0
1180 checkpoint exposure_high

1200 caption Palette: highland
1200 set exposure 1.0
1200 set palette highland
1300 checkpoint palette_highland

1320 caption Palette: neon
1320 set palette neon
1420 checkpoint palette_neon

1440 caption Time of day: morning
1440 set palette classic
1440 set time 0.3
1540 checkpoint time_morning

1560 caption Time of day: sunset
1560 set time 0.72
1660 checkpoint time_sunset

1680 caption Time of day: night
1680 set time 0.95
1780 checkpoint time_night

1800 caption Shadows: off
1800 set time 0.4
1800 set shadows off
1900 checkpoint shadows_off

1920 caption Shadows: on
1920 set shadows on
2020 checkpoint shadows_on

2040 caption Ambient occlusion: off
2040 set ao off
2140 checkpoint ao_off

2160 caption Ambient occlusion: on
2160 set ao on
2260 checkpoint ao_on

2280 caption Fog: off
2280 set fog off
2380 checkpoint fog_off

2400 caption Sky: off
2400 set sky off
2500 checkpoint sky_off

2520 caption Fog and sky: on
2520 set fog on
2520 set sky on
2620 checkpoint fog_sky_on

2640 end
